  <!-- EN: biomutation lance -->
  <Apparel_BiomutationLance.label>lança de biomutação</Apparel_BiomutationLance.label>
  <!-- EN: A limited-use psychic effector. It twists and reshapes the musculature of the target, causing them to transform into a terrifying creature.\n\nThis biomutation lance was crafted from a broken shard of dark archotechnology. -->
  <Apparel_BiomutationLance.description>Um efetor psíquico de uso limitado. Torce e remodela a musculatura do alvo, transformando-o numa criatura aterradora.\n\nEsta lança de biomutação foi fabricada a partir de um fragmento partido de arcotecnologia sombria.</Apparel_BiomutationLance.description>
  <!-- EN: charge -->
  <Apparel_BiomutationLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>carga</Apparel_BiomutationLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <Apparel_BiomutationLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>em recarga</Apparel_BiomutationLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: biomutation lance -->
  <Apparel_BiomutationLance.verbs.biomutation_lance.label>lança de biomutação</Apparel_BiomutationLance.verbs.biomutation_lance.label>
  
  <!-- EN: shard insanity lance -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.label>lança de loucura de fragmento</Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.label>
  <!-- EN: A limited-use psychic effector. It overwhelms the target's mind with terrifying perceptual distortions, driving them into a berserk state. There is a risk of brain damage.\n\nThis insanity lance was crafted from a broken shard of dark archotechnology. It has a shorter range than its non-shard based counterpart and it requires line of sight. -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.description>Um efetor psíquico de uso limitado. Inunda a mente do alvo com distorções percetivas aterradoras, levando-o a um estado de fúria. Existe o risco de danos cerebrais.\n\nEsta lança de loucura foi fabricada a partir de um fragmento partido de arcotecnologia sombria. Tem um alcance menor do que a sua congénere que não é feita de fragmento e requer linha de visão.</Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.description>
  <!-- EN: charge -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>carga</Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>em recarga</Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: shard insanity lance -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.verbs.shard_insanity_lance.label>lança de loucura de fragmento</Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.verbs.shard_insanity_lance.label>
  <!-- EN: psychic insanity immune -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.verbs.shard_insanity_lance.invalidTargetPawn>imune a loucura psíquica</Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.verbs.shard_insanity_lance.invalidTargetPawn>
  
  <!-- EN: shard shock lance -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.label>lança de choque de fragmento</Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.label>
  <!-- EN: A limited-use psychic effector. It shocks the target's mind with chaotic images, blocking coherent perception and dropping them into a state of psychic shock. There is a risk of brain damage.\n\nThis shock lance was crafted from a broken shard of dark archotechnology. It has a shorter range than its non-shard based counterpart and it requires line of sight. -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.description>Um efetor psíquico de uso limitado. Atinge a mente do alvo com imagens caóticas, bloqueando a perceção coerente e deixando-o em estado de choque psíquico. Existe o risco de danos cerebrais.\n\nEsta lança de choque foi fabricada a partir de um fragmento partido de arcotecnologia sombria. Tem um alcance menor do que a sua congénere que não é feita de fragmento e requer linha de visão.</Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.description>
  <!-- EN: charge -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>carga</Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>em recarga</Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: shard shock lance -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.verbs.shard_shock_lance.label>lança de choque de fragmento</Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.verbs.shard_shock_lance.label>
  <!-- EN: psychic shock immune -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.verbs.shard_shock_lance.invalidTargetPawn>imune a choque psíquico</Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.verbs.shard_shock_lance.invalidTargetPawn>
  
